@startuml

title Throttling: a request over the limit is refused or delayed

start
:request from caller C, tenant T;
if (C's rate within its limit\nand T's within its limit?) then (yes)
  :serve it;
  stop
else (no)
  if (can the work wait?) then (yes)
    :queue it, or answer "retry later"\nwith a time;
  else (no)
    :refuse it: rate limited;
  endif
  :log the caller, the tenant and the limit;
  stop
endif
@enduml
